(Leonard:)Good to see you, mother.

3
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,450
(Leonard:)Here's your tea, mother.

4
00:00:14,621 --> 00:00:15,661
- Oolong?
- Yes.

5
00:00:15,831 --> 00:00:17,211
- Loose, not bagged?
- Yes.

6
00:00:17,374 --> 00:00:20,044
- Steeped three minutes? Two-percent milk?
- Yes. Yes.

7
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:21,460
- Warmed separately?
- Yes.

8
00:00:21,628 --> 00:00:23,718
- One teaspoon sugar? Raw sugar?
- Yes. Yes.

9
00:00:26,216 --> 00:00:27,636
(Beverley:)It's cold.

10
00:00:31,096 --> 00:00:33,096
(Leonard:)I'll start again.

11
00:00:34,391 --> 00:00:36,771
(Sheldon:)I have the same problem with him.

12
00:00:39,146 --> 00:00:44,446
(Sheldon:)My theory is that his lack of focus
stems from an over-developed sex drive.

13
00:00:45,235 --> 00:00:47,075
Oh, I don't know where he got that.

14
00:00:47,237 --> 00:00:49,777
Aside from a pro-forma consummation
of our marriage...

15
00:00:49,948 --> 00:00:55,018
(Beverley:)...his father and I only had intercourse
for the purposes of reproduction.

